---
/**
 * The first thing in the tab order, and invisible until it is focused.
 *
 * `sr-only` alone would leave it permanently hidden; the `focus:` variants pull it back into the
 * page the moment it is reached, which is the whole point — a keyboard reader should not have to
 * tab through eleven navigation links on every page to get to the content.
 */
---

<a
  href="#main"
  class="sr-only rounded-control bg-surface px-4 py-3 font-bold text-brand-strong shadow-md focus:not-sr-only focus:absolute focus:start-4 focus:top-4 focus:z-50"
>
  Μετάβαση στο κύριο περιεχόμενο
</a>
